  "cli.help.full": "\n{bold}{cyan}╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {bold}{white}mip v{{version}}{/white}{/bold} - {gray}einfach weil npm scheiße ist{/gray}              {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}  {gray}Plugins, Sicherheit und mehr!{/gray}                                {bold}{cyan}║{/cyan}{/bold}\n{bold}{cyan}╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝{/cyan}{/bold}\n\n{bold}{white}Hauptbefehle:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip init{/cyan}                              {gray}Neues Projekt erstellen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install{/cyan} {gray}[Paket]{/gray}                   {gray}Pakete installieren{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip install -s{/cyan} {gray}[Paket]{/gray}               {gray}SUPER SCHNELLE Installation{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip uninstall{/cyan} {gray}<Paket>{/gray}                 {gray}Paket entfernen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip update{/cyan}                            {gray}Alle Pakete aktualisieren{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip list{/cyan}                              {gray}Installierte Pakete anzeigen{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Information:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip search{/cyan} {gray}<Suchbegriff>{/gray}             {gray}In npm-Registry suchen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip info{/cyan} {gray}<Paket>{/gray}                      {gray}Paketdetails anzeigen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip outdated{/cyan}                           {gray}Veraltete Pakete anzeigen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip why{/cyan} {gray}<Paket>{/gray}                       {gray}Warum ist dieses Paket installiert?{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Sicherheit:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip audit{/cyan}                             {gray}Schwachstellen prüfen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip doctor{/cyan}                            {gray}Systemdiagnose{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Entwicklung:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip create{/cyan} {gray}<Vorlage> <Name>{/gray}           {gray}Aus Vorlage erstellen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip run{/cyan} {gray}<Skript>{/gray}                     {gray}npm-Skript ausführen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip exec{/cyan} {gray}<Befehl>{/gray}                    {gray}Lokale Binärdatei ausführen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip link{/cyan}                              {gray}Lokale Pakete verknüpfen{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Aliase:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip alias set{/cyan} {gray}<Name> <Befehl>{/gray}        {gray}Alias erstellen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias remove{/cyan} {gray}<Name>{/gray}              {gray}Alias entfernen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias list{/cyan}                          {gray}Alle Aliase anzeigen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip alias clear{/cyan}                         {gray}Alle Aliase löschen{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Monorepos:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces list{/cyan}                   {gray}Workspaces auflisten{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip workspaces run{/cyan} {gray}<Skript>{/gray}           {gray}Skript in allen Workspaces ausführen{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Wartung:{/white}{/bold}\n  {cyan}mip cache clean{/cyan}                       {gray}Cache leeren{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip cache size{/cyan}                        {gray}Cache-Größe anzeigen{/gray}\n  {cyan}mip ci{/cyan}                                {gray}CI-Installation{/gray}\n\n{bold}{white}Beispiele:{/white}{/bold}\n  {gray}mip install -s express{/gray}                {gray}Super schnelle Installation{/gray}\n  {gray}mip install lodash --save-dev{/gray}\n  {gray}mip create react my-app{/gray}\n  {gray}mip why lodash{/gray}\n  {gray}mip cache clean{/gray}\n  {gray}mip doctor{/gray}\n  {gray}mip alias set i install{/gray}               {gray}Alias für install{/gray}\n  {gray}mip i express{/gray}                         {gray}Alias verwenden{/gray}\n\n{bold}{yellow}Super-Schnellmodus-Funktionen:{/yellow}{/bold}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Paralleler Download{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Stream-Extraktion{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Intelligentes Caching{/gray}\n  {green}✓{/green} {gray}Blitzschnelle Wiederholungsinstallationen{/gray}\n  ",

